    "Condition : 1 - The single storey rear extension, by reason of its size, excessive height, position, use of materials and appearance, harms the appearance of the existing building and neither preserve nor enhances the character and appearance of the Bedford Park Conservation Area. Therefore the proposed development complies with the relevant London Borough of Hounslow Unitary Development Plan 2003 policies; ENV-B.1.1 New Development, ENV-B.2.2 Conservation Areas and H.6.4 Extensions and Alterations.",
